# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
# 第 10 批（C1）：水污染防治法（107/6/13）第1條～第39條之1
W = "ENV-07"
Q = [

(W,"第1條",1,"水污法-立法目的",
 "水污染防治法之立法目的為何？本法未規定之事項應如何處理？",
 ["防治水污染、確保水資源清潔、維護生態體系、改善生活環境、增進國民健康；本法未規定者適用其他法令之規定","促進水利事業發展、確保供水穩定、維護灌溉秩序、改善農業環境、增進農民收益；本法規定優先於其他法令","管理自來水事業、確保飲用水安全、維護管線設施、改善用水品質、增進用水效率；其他法令不得另有規定","推動水域遊憩發展、確保親水安全、維護河川景觀、改善觀光環境、增進地方收入；其他法令一律不予適用"],"a",
 "第1條：為防治水污染，確保水資源之清潔，以維護生態體系，改善生活環境，增進國民健康，特制定本法；本法未規定者，適用其他法令之規定。第3條並定中央主管機關為行政院環境保護署。",
 "What is the legislative purpose of the Water Pollution Control Act, and what governs matters it does not cover?",
 ["Prevent water pollution, keep water resources clean, protect ecosystems, improve the living environment and public health; other laws apply where this Act is silent","Promote water conservancy, secure stable supply, maintain irrigation order, improve the farming environment and farmer income; this Act prevails over other laws","Manage tap water utilities, ensure drinking water safety, maintain pipelines, improve water quality and use efficiency; no other law may regulate these","Promote water recreation, ensure bathing safety, preserve river scenery, improve the tourism environment and local income; no other law is ever applicable"],
 "Article 1; the central competent authority is set by Article 3."),

(W,"第2條",2,"水污法-定義",
 "依本法用詞定義，事業包括哪些主體？廢水與污水如何區別？",
 ["事業指公司、工廠、礦場、廢水代處理業、畜牧業或其他經中央主管機關指定者；廢水由事業所產生，污水為事業以外所產生","事業僅指公司、工廠及礦場，畜牧業不屬之；污水為事業於製造或操作過程所產生，廢水則指事業以外之場所所產生","事業指經地方主管機關登記之工廠與礦場等場所；廢水指含有重金屬之水，污水指僅含有機物而不含重金屬之水","事業指所有營利與非營利機構並包含一般家戶在內；廢水指已經處理之水，污水則指尚未經過任何處理之原水"],"a",
 "第2條第7款：事業指公司、工廠、礦場、廢水代處理業、畜牧業或其他經中央主管機關指定之事業。第8款廢水指事業於製造、操作、自然資源開發過程中或作業環境所產生含污染物之水；第9款污水指事業以外所產生含污染物之水。",
 "Which entities count as an enterprise, and how do wastewater and sewage differ?",
 ["Companies, factories, mines, wastewater treatment agents, livestock farms or others designated centrally; wastewater comes from enterprises, sewage from non-enterprises","Only companies, factories and mines, livestock farms excluded; sewage arises from enterprise manufacturing or operation, wastewater from places other than enterprises","Only factories and mines registered with the local authority; wastewater means water containing heavy metals, sewage means water with organics but no heavy metals","All profit and non-profit bodies including ordinary households; wastewater means already treated water, sewage means raw water that has not been treated at all"],
 "Article 2, subparagraphs 7 to 9."),

(W,"第2條",2,"水污法-定義",
 "依本法定義，水污染防治措施包含哪些方法？污水下水道系統之範圍為何？",
 ["設置廢污水處理設施、納入污水下水道系統、土壤處理、委託代處理、管線排放海洋、海洋投棄或其他經中央許可者；指公共及專用下水道之收集、抽送、傳運、處理與最後處置設施","僅指設置廢污水處理設施及納入污水下水道系統二種方法，其餘方式均不得採行；指工業區內專供事業使用之廢水收集管線，不含公共下水道及社區專用下水道","設置貯留設施、稀釋廢水、加藥中和或直接放流於土壤等方法，均由地方主管機關核定；指自來水事業之取水、淨水及配水管線等全部設施，不含污水處理廠","限於委託廢水代處理業處理及海洋投棄二種，其他方法應報請立法院同意；指建築物內之衛生下水道管線，僅涵蓋收集及抽送，不包括處理與最後處置"],"a",
 "第2條第11款：水污染防治措施指設置廢（污）水處理設施、納入污水下水道系統、土壤處理、委託廢水代處理業處理、設置管線排放於海洋、海洋投棄或其他經中央主管機關許可之防治水污染方法。第12款：污水下水道系統指公共下水道及專用下水道之廢（污）水收集、抽送、傳運、處理及最後處置之各種設施。",
 "What counts as water pollution control measures, and what does a sewer system cover?",
 ["Treatment facilities, sewer connection, soil treatment, contracted treatment, ocean outfall pipelines, ocean dumping or other centrally approved methods; public and dedicated sewers covering collection, pumping, conveyance, treatment and final disposal","Only installing treatment facilities and connecting to public sewers, with every other method expressly forbidden; only the wastewater pipelines serving enterprises inside industrial parks, excluding public sewers and community dedicated sewers","Storage, dilution, chemical neutralisation or direct discharge to soil, each approved by the local authority; all intake, purification and distribution mains of a water utility, excluding sewage treatment plants","Only contracted treatment by wastewater agents and ocean dumping, others needing legislative consent; building sanitary drains only, covering collection and pumping but not treatment or final disposal"],
 "Article 2, subparagraphs 11 and 12."),

(W,"第2條",2,"水污法-定義",
 "依本法定義，涵容能力、放流口、放流水標準分別指什麼？",
 ["涵容能力指不妨害水體正常用途下水體所能涵容污染物之量；放流口指進入承受水體前依法設置之固定放流設施；放流水標準指對放流水品質或成分之規定限度","涵容能力指處理設施每日可處理之最大廢水量；放流口指廠內任何可排水之開口皆屬之；放流水標準指主管機關對水體品質依最佳用途所定之量度標準","涵容能力指水體於枯水期之最低流量數值；放流口指設於承受水體中央之採樣位置；放流水標準指經主管機關劃定範圍內全部或部分水體之分類","涵容能力指事業獲准排放之年總量上限；放流口指污水下水道系統之人孔蓋位置；放流水標準指水體所能容納污染物而不影響用途之總量管制值"],"a",
 "第2條第15款涵容能力、第13款放流口、第18款放流水標準之定義；第17款水質標準則指主管機關對水體品質依其最佳用途所定之量度，二者不可混淆。第7條規定排放廢（污）水於地面水體應符合放流水標準。",
 "What do assimilative capacity, discharge outlet and effluent standards mean?",
 ["Assimilative capacity is the pollutant load a body can absorb without impairing its normal use; an outlet is the fixed lawful discharge facility before the receiving body; effluent standards are limits on effluent quality or composition","Assimilative capacity is the maximum daily flow that a treatment plant can handle; an outlet is any opening on the site from which water may flow out; effluent standards are the authority's measure of water body quality by its best use","Assimilative capacity is the minimum dry season flow of a water body; an outlet is the sampling point set in mid-channel of the receiving water; effluent standards are the classification of a designated water zone","Assimilative capacity is the annual permitted discharge ceiling of an enterprise; an outlet is the manhole cover of a sewer system; effluent standards are the total load a body may take without impairing its use"],
 "Article 2, subparagraphs 13, 15 and 18."),

(W,"第3條",1,"水污法-主管機關",
 "本法所稱主管機關，在中央、直轄市及縣（市）分別為何機關？",
 ["中央為行政院環境保護署，直轄市為直轄市政府，縣（市）為縣（市）政府","中央為經濟部水利署，直轄市為直轄市水利局，縣（市）為縣（市）水利處","中央為行政院農業委員會，直轄市為直轄市農業局，縣（市）為縣市農業處","中央為內政部營建署，直轄市為直轄市下水道工程處，縣（市）為縣市工務局"],"a",
 "第3條：中央主管機關為行政院環境保護署（現為環境部），直轄市為直轄市政府，縣（市）為縣（市）政府。第64條並規定本法所定之處罰，除另有規定外，依此分級由各該主管機關為之。",
 "Which bodies are the competent authorities at central, municipal and county levels?",
 ["The Environmental Protection Administration centrally, the municipal government in special municipalities, the county or city government locally","The Water Resources Agency of the Ministry of Economic Affairs centrally, the municipal water bureau, and the county or city water office locally","The Council of Agriculture centrally, municipal agriculture bureaux, and county or city agriculture departments at the local level","The Construction and Planning Agency centrally, municipal sewerage engineering offices, and county or city public works bureaux"],
 "Article 3; penalties are imposed at the matching level under Article 64."),

(W,"第4條",1,"水污法-專責機構",
 "各級主管機關為辦理水污染研究、訓練及防治有關事宜，得如何辦理？",
 ["得指定或委託專責機構辦理水污染研究、訓練及防治之有關事宜","應自行設立水污染研究所辦理，不得指定或委託其他任何機構","應報請立法院同意後始得委託民間機構辦理相關研究訓練事宜","僅得委託公立大學辦理研究，訓練及防治事項不得對外委託"],"a",
 "第4條：中央、直轄市、縣（市）主管機關得指定或委託專責機構，辦理水污染研究、訓練及防治之有關事宜。第10條並規定各級主管機關得委託有關機關（構）及中央主管機關許可之檢驗測定機構辦理水質監測。",
 "How may competent authorities handle water pollution research, training and control affairs?",
 ["They may designate or commission a dedicated institution to handle water pollution research, training and control matters","They must set up their own water pollution research institute and may not designate or commission any other body","They must obtain the Legislative Yuan's consent before commissioning any private institution for such research or training","They may commission public universities for research only, while training and control work may never be outsourced"],
 "Article 4; see also Article 10 on commissioned monitoring."),

(W,"第5條",1,"水污法-涵容能力",
 "利用水體承受或傳運放流水者，受到什麼限制？其目的為何？",
 ["不得超過該水體之涵容能力，目的在避免妨害水體之用途","不得超過該水體之年平均流量，目的在維持航運通行順暢","不得超過主管機關核定之取水量，目的在確保灌溉用水量","不得超過放流口之設計流速上限，目的在避免河岸沖刷崩塌"],"a",
 "第5條：為避免妨害水體之用途，利用水體以承受或傳運放流水者，不得超過水體之涵容能力。第9條並規定以放流水標準管制仍未能達水質標準者，應以總量管制方式管制。",
 "What limit applies to using a water body to receive or convey effluent, and why?",
 ["It may not exceed the assimilative capacity of that water body, so as not to impair the uses of the water","It may not exceed the annual average flow of that water body, so as to keep navigation channels passable","It may not exceed the intake volume approved by the authority, so as to secure irrigation water supply","It may not exceed the design flow velocity of the outlet, so as to avoid scouring and bank collapse"],
 "Article 5; see Article 9 on total load control."),

(W,"第6條",2,"水污法-水區水質標準",
 "水區劃定、水體分類及水質標準應由何機關訂定？劃定水區時應如何辦理？",
 ["由中央主管機關依水體特質及所在地情況訂定，並得交直轄市、縣（市）主管機關為之；劃定水區應由主管機關會商水體用途相關單位訂定","由直轄市、縣（市）主管機關逕行訂定後報中央備查，中央不得介入；劃定水區應由主管機關逕行公告，無須與任何相關單位會商","由經濟部水利署依河川流域特性訂定並公告實施；劃定水區應先舉辦公民投票，經該水區居民過半數同意後始得公告生效","由中央主管機關會同立法院相關委員會共同訂定；劃定水區應報請行政院核定，並經該水區內各事業書面同意始得為之"],"a",
 "第6條：中央主管機關應依水體特質及其所在地之情況，劃定水區，訂定水體分類及水質標準，並得交直轄市、縣（市）主管機關為之；劃定水區應由主管機關會商水體用途相關單位訂定之。第2條第16款、第17款並定義水區與水質標準。",
 "Who sets water zones, water body classifications and water quality standards, and how are zones delimited?",
 ["The central authority sets them by water body character and local conditions and may delegate them to municipal or county authorities; zones are set after consulting units concerned with the water uses","Municipal and county authorities set them directly and merely report to the centre, which may not intervene; zones are announced unilaterally without consulting any related unit","The Water Resources Agency sets them by river basin characteristics and announces them; zones must first be put to a local referendum and approved by a majority of the residents to take effect","The central authority sets them jointly with Legislative Yuan committees; zones require Executive Yuan approval and the written consent of every enterprise inside them"],
 "Article 6; definitions in Article 2, subparagraphs 16 and 17."),

(W,"第7條",2,"水污法-放流水標準",
 "事業排放廢（污）水於地面水體應符合何標準？該標準由何機關訂定？",
 ["應符合放流水標準；由中央主管機關會商相關目的事業主管機關定之，內容包括適用範圍、管制方式、項目、濃度或總量限值及研訂基準","應符合水體分類水質標準；由直轄市、縣（市）主管機關逕行訂定並公告，內容包括適用範圍、管制方式、項目及各項濃度或總量之限值","應符合飲用水水質標準；由中央主管機關會商立法院訂定，內容包括適用範圍、檢驗頻率、採樣位置、濃度限值及研訂基準等事項","應符合土壤處理標準；由各目的事業主管機關分別訂定後報中央核備，內容包括管制方式、項目、濃度限值及作物吸收試驗基準"],"a",
 "第7條第1項：事業、污水下水道系統或建築物污水處理設施排放廢（污）水於地面水體者，應符合放流水標準。第2項：放流水標準由中央主管機關會商相關目的事業主管機關定之。違反者依第40條至第42條分別處罰。",
 "Which standard must effluent discharged to surface water meet, and who sets it?",
 ["Effluent standards; set by the central authority in consultation with the relevant industry authorities, covering scope, control mode, items, concentration or total load limits and criteria","Water body classification quality standards; set and announced directly by municipal or county authorities, covering scope, control mode, items and concentration or load limits","Drinking water quality standards; set by the central authority together with the Legislative Yuan, covering scope, test frequency, sampling points, concentration limits and criteria","Soil treatment standards; set separately by each industry authority and filed with the centre, covering control mode, items, concentration limits and crop uptake test criteria"],
 "Article 7, paragraphs 1 and 2."),

(W,"第7條",3,"水污法-加嚴標準",
 "直轄市、縣（市）主管機關可否加嚴轄內之放流水標準？其程序為何？",
 ["得視轄區內環境特殊或需特予保護之水體，就排放總量或濃度、管制項目或方式增訂或加嚴，報請中央主管機關會商相關目的事業主管機關後核定","一律不得增訂或加嚴，放流水標準之管制項目與限值全部由中央主管機關統一訂定，地方僅能負責執行稽查與處分而無任何訂定權限","得逕行公告加嚴標準並立即施行，無須報請中央核定，僅需於公告後三十日內將加嚴之管制項目及限值函報中央主管機關備查即可","僅得放寬而不得加嚴轄內標準，且應先取得轄內事業過半數之書面同意，並報請中央主管機關會商目的事業主管機關後核定"],"a",
 "第7條第2項後段：直轄市、縣（市）主管機關得視轄區內環境特殊或需特予保護之水體，就排放總量或濃度、管制項目或方式，增訂或加嚴轄內之放流水標準，報請中央主管機關會商相關目的事業主管機關後核定之。",
 "May local authorities tighten effluent standards in their jurisdiction, and by what procedure?",
 ["Yes, for special or specially protected waters they may add to or tighten load, concentration, items or control modes, subject to central approval after consulting the industry authorities","No, they may never add to or tighten anything, since all control items and limits are set uniformly by the central authority while localities merely inspect and impose penalties","Yes, they may announce tightened standards effective immediately without central approval, only filing the items and limits with the central authority within thirty days","They may only relax and never tighten local standards, and must first obtain written consent from a majority of local enterprises plus central approval after consultation"],
 "Article 7, paragraph 2, latter part."),

(W,"第8條",1,"水污法-污泥處理",
 "事業、污水下水道系統及建築物污水處理設施廢（污）水處理所產生之污泥，應如何處理？",
 ["應妥善處理，不得任意放置或棄置","得暫置於廠區空地，不受任何限制","應全部運至海洋投棄，不得陸上處理","得作為農地肥料使用，無須任何處理"],"a",
 "第8條：事業、污水下水道系統及建築物污水處理設施之廢（污）水處理，其產生之污泥，應妥善處理，不得任意放置或棄置。違反者，事業或污水下水道系統依第40條處新臺幣六萬元以上二千萬元以下罰鍰。",
 "How must sludge from wastewater treatment be handled?",
 ["It must be properly treated and may not be arbitrarily placed or dumped","It may be stored on open ground within the plant without any restriction","It must all be dumped at sea and may not be treated or handled on land","It may be used directly as farmland fertiliser without any treatment at all"],
 "Article 8; penalties under Article 40."),

(W,"第9條",2,"水污法-總量管制",
 "水體在何種情形下，直轄市、縣（市）主管機關應以總量管制方式管制？",
 ["因事業、污水下水道系統密集，以放流水標準管制仍未能達到該水體之水質標準者，或經主管機關認定需特予保護者","僅限於該水體流經二個以上直轄市、縣（市）者，或該水體之年平均流量低於主管機關所定基準值而有枯竭之虞者","僅限於水體位於飲用水水源水質保護區內者，或該水體沿岸三公里內設有工業區並經目的事業主管機關同意者","僅限於水體經中央主管機關公告為海洋放流管線排放區者，或該水體之魚類數量經調查較前一年度顯著減少者"],"a",
 "第9條第1項：水體之全部或部分，因事業、污水下水道系統密集，以放流水標準管制仍未能達到該水體水質標準，或經主管機關認定需特予保護者，直轄市、縣（市）主管機關應依該水體涵容能力，以廢（污）水排放之總量管制方式管制之。違反總量管制方式者依第43條處罰。",
 "In what circumstances must local authorities apply total load control to a water body?",
 ["Where enterprises and sewer systems are so dense that effluent standards still fail to meet the water quality standard, or where the authority finds special protection needed","Only where the water body crosses two or more municipalities or counties, or where its annual mean flow falls below the official threshold and depletion is feared","Only where the water body lies inside a drinking water source protection area, or where an industrial park sits within three kilometres with industry authority consent","Only where the body has been announced as an ocean outfall discharge area, or where surveys show fish numbers markedly lower than in the previous year"],
 "Article 9, paragraph 1; penalties under Article 43."),

(W,"第9條",3,"水污法-總量管制核定",
 "總量管制方式應由何機關擬訂及核定？涉及二直轄市、縣（市）者如何處理？",
 ["由直轄市、縣（市）主管機關擬訂，報請中央主管機關會商相關目的事業主管機關後核定；涉及二直轄市、縣（市）者由中央主管機關會商相關目的事業主管機關定之","由中央主管機關擬訂後交由地方公告實施，地方不得表示意見；涉及二直轄市、縣（市）者由該二地方主管機關自行協議定之，協議不成報行政院裁決","由目的事業主管機關擬訂後報請立法院審議通過；涉及二直轄市、縣（市）者由流域面積較大之一方主管機關擬訂，並通知另一方配合辦理即可","由事業與污水下水道系統共同協商擬訂後報地方核備；涉及二直轄市、縣（市）者由中央主管機關委託專責機構擬訂，報請行政院核定後公告"],"a",
 "第9條第2項：總量管制方式由直轄市、縣（市）主管機關擬訂，報請中央主管機關會商相關目的事業主管機關後核定之；水體之部分或全部涉及二直轄市、縣（市）者，或涉及中央各目的事業主管機關主管之特定區域，由中央主管機關會商相關目的事業主管機關定之。",
 "Who drafts and approves the total load control scheme, and what if two jurisdictions are involved?",
 ["Local authorities draft it and the central authority approves it after consulting industry authorities; where two jurisdictions are involved the central authority sets it after such consultation","The central authority drafts it and localities merely announce it without comment; where two jurisdictions are involved they negotiate, and the Executive Yuan rules if talks fail","Industry authorities draft it and submit it to the Legislative Yuan for approval; where two jurisdictions are involved the one with the larger basin drafts it and notifies the other","Enterprises and sewer systems jointly draft it and file it locally for recordation; where two jurisdictions are involved a commissioned institution drafts it for Executive Yuan approval"],
 "Article 9, paragraph 2."),

(W,"第10條",2,"水污法-水質監測",
 "各級主管機關設置之水質監測站，其採樣頻率原則為何？",
 ["應視污染物項目特性每月或每季一次為原則，必要時應增加頻率","應一律每日採樣一次為原則，必要時得減少為每週採樣一次","應視水體大小每半年或每年一次為原則，必要時得增加頻率","應由受監測之事業自行決定頻率，主管機關僅負責彙整結果"],"a",
 "第10條第1項、第2項：各級主管機關應設水質監測站，定期監測及公告檢驗結果並採取適當措施；採樣頻率應視污染物項目特性每月或每季一次為原則，必要時應增加頻率。監測站之設置及監測準則由中央主管機關定之。",
 "What is the sampling frequency principle for water quality monitoring stations?",
 ["Monthly or quarterly in principle according to the nature of the pollutant, with more frequent sampling when necessary","Daily sampling in principle for every station, which may be reduced to weekly sampling whenever necessary","Every six months or annually in principle according to the size of the water body, increased where necessary","Decided by the monitored enterprise itself, the authority merely compiling the results that are reported"],
 "Article 10, paragraphs 1 and 2."),

(W,"第10條",3,"水污法-監測結果不符",
 "公告之檢驗結果未符合水體分類水質標準時，各目的事業主管機關應如何處理？",
 ["應定期監測水體中食用植物、魚、蝦、貝類及底泥中重金屬、毒性化學物質及農藥含量，有危害之虞時並應採取禁止採捕食用水產動植物之措施","應立即命該水體沿岸所有事業全面停工停業，並於六個月內完成整治，屆期未完成者由目的事業主管機關代為執行並向事業求償全部費用","應將該水體重新分類為較低等級之水體，使其水質符合新分類之標準，並公告解除該水體原有之飲用水水源水質保護區範圍","應報請中央主管機關撤銷該水區之劃定，改由中央主管機關直接管理，地方主管機關自公告日起不再負責該水體之監測工作"],"a",
 "第10條第5項：第一項公告之檢驗結果未符合水體分類水質標準時，各目的事業主管機關應定期監測水體中食用植物、魚、蝦、貝類及底泥中重金屬、毒性化學物質及農藥含量，如有致危害人體健康、農漁業生產之虞時，並應採取禁止採捕食用水產動、植物之措施。",
 "If announced results fail the classification water quality standard, what must industry authorities do?",
 ["Regularly monitor heavy metals, toxic chemicals and pesticides in edible plants, fish, shrimp, shellfish and sediment, and ban harvesting for consumption where harm is feared","Immediately order every enterprise along the bank to halt operations and complete remediation within six months, acting in their place and recovering all costs if they fail","Reclassify the water body into a lower category so its quality meets the new standard, and revoke the drinking water source quality protection area covering it","Ask the central authority to revoke the water zone designation and take over management directly, the local authority ceasing all monitoring from that day"],
 "Article 10, paragraph 5."),

(W,"第11條",2,"水污法-水污費",
 "水污染防治費之徵收對象為何？中央與地方各向誰徵收？",
 ["中央對排放廢（污）水於地面水體之事業及污水下水道系統徵收；地方政府對下水道使用區域內未將污水排洩於下水道之家戶徵收","中央對所有用水戶按用水量統一徵收；地方政府對轄內全部事業依其資本額徵收，不論其是否排放廢（污）水於地面水體均應繳納","中央對自來水事業及水利事業徵收；地方政府對已將污水排洩於下水道之家戶徵收，未接管之家戶因未使用下水道故不必繳納","中央對建築物污水處理設施所有人徵收；地方政府對農田水利會及灌溉渠道使用人徵收，事業則由目的事業主管機關代為徵收"],"a",
 "第11條第1項：中央主管機關對排放廢（污）水於地面水體之事業及污水下水道系統（不含公共污水下水道系統及社區專用污水下水道系統），依其排放水質水量核定並徵收水污染防治費。第2項：地方政府應對下水道使用區域內未將污水排洩於下水道之家戶徵收。未依期限繳納者依第44條處罰。",
 "Who pays the water pollution control fee, and who collects from whom?",
 ["The centre collects from enterprises and sewer systems discharging to surface water; local governments collect from households in sewer service areas not connected to the sewer","The centre collects from all water users by consumption; local governments collect from every enterprise by capital, whether or not it discharges to surface water at all","The centre collects from tap water and water conservancy utilities; local governments collect from households already discharging into the sewer, unconnected ones paying nothing","The centre collects from owners of building sewage facilities; local governments collect from irrigation associations and canal users, enterprises paying via industry authorities"],
 "Article 11, paragraphs 1 and 2; penalties under Article 44."),

(W,"第11條",3,"水污法-水污費支用",
 "水污染防治費之用途受何限制？聘僱執行收費及建設管理人員之支用比例上限為何？",
 ["應專供全國水污染防治之用；聘僱人員支用比例不得高於各類別之百分之十","應專供各該地方建設之用；聘僱人員支用比例不得高於各類別之百分之三十","得作為各級政府一般預算財源；聘僱人員支用比例不得高於各類別之百分之五","應優先撥充地方教育經費使用；聘僱人員支用比例不得高於各類別之百分之二十"],"a",
 "第11條第3項：水污染防治費應專供全國水污染防治之用，並列舉支用類別及項目。第4項：第三項第一款第五目及第二款第六目（聘僱執行收費及公共污水下水道系統建設管理人員）之支用比例不得高於各類別之百分之十。第6項並規定各級主管機關應設置特種基金。",
 "How may the water pollution control fee be used, and what caps staff hiring spending?",
 ["It is reserved for nationwide water pollution control; hiring may not exceed ten percent of each category","It is reserved for local public construction works; hiring may not exceed thirty percent of each category","It may serve as general budget revenue at each level; hiring may not exceed five percent of each category","It must first be allocated to local education funding; hiring may not exceed twenty percent of each category"],
 "Article 11, paragraphs 3, 4 and 6."),

(W,"第12條",1,"水污法-防治方案",
 "水污染防治方案應由何機關訂定？其執行進度應如何處理？",
 ["由中央主管機關會商直轄市、縣（市）主管機關訂定，每年向立法院報告執行進度","由直轄市、縣（市）主管機關各自訂定，每三年向中央主管機關報告執行進度","由行政院會同立法院共同訂定，每半年向監察院提出執行進度書面報告","由各目的事業主管機關分別訂定，執行進度僅須留存備查無須對外報告"],"a",
 "第12條：污水下水道建設與污水處理設施應符合水污染防治政策之需要；中央主管機關應會商直轄市、縣（市）主管機關訂定水污染防治方案，每年向立法院報告執行進度。第11條第8項並要求水污染防治執行績效逐年檢討並向立法院報告及備查。",
 "Who formulates the water pollution control programme and how is progress reported?",
 ["The central authority, in consultation with municipal and county authorities, reporting progress annually to the Legislative Yuan","Each municipal and county authority separately, reporting progress to the central authority once every three years","The Executive Yuan together with the Legislative Yuan, reporting progress in writing to the Control Yuan every six months","Each industry competent authority separately, with progress merely kept on file and never reported to anyone"],
 "Article 12; see also Article 11, paragraph 8."),

(W,"第13條",2,"水污法-防治措施計畫",
 "事業於設立或變更前，應先辦理何種程序？向何機關辦理？",
 ["應先檢具水污染防治措施計畫及相關文件，送直轄市、縣（市）主管機關或中央主管機關委託之機關審查核准","應先檢具環境影響評估報告書及相關文件，送中央主管機關審查通過，並取得目的事業主管機關之設廠同意函","應先檢具放流水水質檢測報告及相關文件，送當地鄉鎮市公所備查，並於設立後三個月內補送主管機關核備","應先檢具工廠登記證及廢水處理設施平面圖，送中央主管機關委託之檢驗測定機構完成簽證後即可逕行設立"],"a",
 "第13條第1項：事業於設立或變更前，應先檢具水污染防治措施計畫及相關文件，送直轄市、縣（市）主管機關或中央主管機關委託之機關審查核准。第2項：適用之事業種類、範圍及規模由中央主管機關會商目的事業主管機關指定公告。違反第四項所定辦法者依第46條處罰。",
 "What must an enterprise do before establishment or alteration, and with whom?",
 ["Submit a water pollution control measure plan with supporting documents to the local authority or an agency commissioned by the central authority for review and approval","Submit an environmental impact assessment report with documents to the central authority for approval and obtain a plant consent letter from the industry authority","Submit an effluent quality test report with documents to the township office for recordation, filing with the authority within three months after establishment","Submit the factory registration and a treatment facility layout to a testing organisation commissioned centrally, and may establish once certification is complete"],
 "Article 13, paragraphs 1 and 2; penalties under Article 46."),

(W,"第13條",2,"水污法-管線排放海洋",
 "水污染防治措施計畫屬以管線排放海洋者，其管線相關事項由何機關規定？計畫內容由何機關定之？",
 ["管線之設置、變更、撤銷、廢止、停用、申請文件及程序等事項，與計畫之內容、應具備文件、申請時機及審核依據，均由中央主管機關定之","管線相關事項由交通部航港局定之，計畫之內容、應具備文件、申請時機及審核依據則由直轄市、縣（市）主管機關視轄區情形分別定之","管線相關事項由目的事業主管機關定之，計畫之內容、應具備文件、申請時機及審核依據則由事業委託之環境工程技師依專業判斷認定","管線相關事項由行政院海洋委員會定之，計畫之內容、應具備文件、申請時機及審核依據則由中央主管機關報請立法院同意後公告實施"],"a",
 "第13條第3項：水污染防治措施計畫之內容、應具備文件、申請時機、審核依據及其他應遵行事項，由中央主管機關定之。第4項：屬以管線排放海洋者，其管線之設置、變更、撤銷、廢止、停用、申請文件、程序及其他應遵行事項，由中央主管機關定之。",
 "For plans discharging to the sea by pipeline, who prescribes pipeline matters and plan content?",
 ["The central authority prescribes both the installation, alteration, revocation, abolition, suspension, documents and procedure for pipelines and the plan content, documents, timing and review basis","The Maritime and Port Bureau prescribes pipeline matters, while local authorities separately prescribe plan content, documents, timing and review basis for their own areas","The industry competent authority prescribes pipeline matters, while plan content, documents, timing and review basis are judged by the engineer the enterprise commissions","The Ocean Affairs Council prescribes all pipeline matters, while the plan content, required documents, application timing and review basis are announced by the central authority with Legislative Yuan consent"],
 "Article 13, paragraphs 3 and 4."),

(W,"第14條",2,"水污法-排放許可",
 "事業排放廢（污）水於地面水體，應先取得何種文件？登記事項變更時如何辦理？",
 ["應向直轄市、縣（市）主管機關申請核發排放許可證或簡易排放許可文件，並依登記事項運作；登記事項有變更者應於變更前提出申請，經審查核准始可變更","應向中央主管機關申請核發水污染防治措施計畫核准函，並依核准內容運作；登記事項有變更者得於變更後三十日內補行申報，無須事先申請核准","應向目的事業主管機關申請核發工廠排水登記證，並依登記事項運作；登記事項有變更者應於變更後六個月內辦理變更登記，逾期始須申請核准","應向當地環保稽查大隊辦理放流口編號登記，並依登記事項運作；登記事項有變更者僅需自行記載於操作紀錄簿，備供主管機關查核即可"],"a",
 "第14條第1項：事業排放廢（污）水於地面水體者，應向直轄市、縣（市）主管機關申請核發排放許可證或簡易排放許可文件後，並依登記事項運作，始得排放；登記事項有變更者，應於變更前提出申請，經審查核准始可變更。未取得許可即排放者依第45條第1項處罰並應令全部停工或停業。",
 "What document is needed to discharge to surface water, and how are registered items changed?",
 ["Apply to the local authority for a discharge permit or simplified permit document and operate as registered; changes must be applied for beforehand and may be made only once approved","Apply to the central authority for approval of the control measure plan and operate accordingly; changes may be filed within thirty days afterwards without prior approval","Apply to the industry authority for a factory drainage registration and operate as registered; changes may be registered within six months afterwards, approval being needed only if late","Register the outlet number with the local inspection brigade and operate as registered; changes need only be noted in the operating log for inspection by the authority"],
 "Article 14, paragraph 1; penalties under Article 45."),

(W,"第14條",3,"水污法-變更期限",
 "排放許可登記事項未涉及廢（污）水、污泥之產生、收集、處理或排放之變更者，如何辦理？",
 ["經中央主管機關指定者，得於規定期限辦理變更，不受應於變更前申請核准之限制","一律仍應於變更前提出申請並經審查核准，任何情形均不得於事後補辦變更登記","得由事業自行變更並記載於紀錄簿，無須向任何主管機關申請亦無須事後申報","應報經目的事業主管機關同意後變更，並於變更後一年內函報中央主管機關備查"],"a",
 "第14條第2項：前項登記事項未涉及廢（污）水、污泥之產生、收集、處理或排放之變更，並經中央主管機關指定者，得於規定期限辦理變更。違反第十四條第二項者，依第45條第3項處新臺幣一萬元以上六十萬元以下罰鍰，並通知限期補正。",
 "How are registered items changed when they do not involve wastewater or sludge generation, collection, treatment or discharge?",
 ["Where designated by the central authority, the change may be filed within the prescribed period, escaping the prior application and approval requirement","Prior application and approval are still required in every case, and no change may ever be registered after it has already been made","The enterprise may change it itself and note it in the log, with no application to any authority and no subsequent reporting at all","Consent of the industry competent authority must be obtained first, with the change filed with the central authority for recordation within one year afterwards"],
 "Article 14, paragraph 2; penalties under Article 45, paragraph 3."),

(W,"第14條之1",3,"水污法-資訊揭露",
 "經中央主管機關指定公告之事業申請或變更許可時，應揭露何事項？其廢水含標準管制以外污染物且有危害之虞者應提出何文件？",
 ["應揭露排放廢（污）水可能含有之污染物及其濃度與排放量；經地方主管機關認定有危害生態或人體健康之虞者，應提出風險評估與管理報告","應揭露廠內全部原物料清單及製程配方比例；經地方主管機關認定有危害之虞者，應提出環境影響評估報告書並辦理公開說明會後始得排放","應揭露最近三年之營業額與繳稅資料；經中央主管機關認定有危害之虞者，應提出財務保證文件及污染整治基金提撥計畫供主管機關審查","應揭露員工人數及廢水處理專責人員名冊；經目的事業主管機關認定有危害之虞者，應提出健康檢查報告及勞工作業環境監測結果"],"a",
 "第14條之1第1項、第2項：經指定公告之事業於申請、變更水污染防治措施計畫、排放許可證或簡易排放許可文件時，應揭露排放廢（污）水可能含有之污染物及其濃度與排放量；含放流水標準管制以外污染物並經地方主管機關認定有危害生態或人體健康之虞者，應提出風險評估與管理報告。第4項：經評估有必要者應於放流水標準新增管制項目。",
 "What must designated enterprises disclose on application, and what report is required for unregulated pollutants?",
 ["The pollutants their effluent may contain with concentrations and discharge volumes; a risk assessment and management report where the local authority finds ecological or health risk","A full list of raw materials and process formulations; an environmental impact assessment report plus a public briefing where the local authority finds a risk","Turnover and tax records for the past three years; financial guarantee documents and a remediation fund plan where the central authority finds a risk","Staff numbers and the full roster of dedicated wastewater treatment personnel; employee health check records and workplace environment monitoring results where the industry authority finds a risk"],
 "Article 14-1, paragraphs 1, 2 and 4."),

(W,"第15條",2,"水污法-許可有效期",
 "排放許可證及簡易排放許可文件之有效期間為何？展延應於何時申請？",
 ["有效期間為五年，期滿仍繼續使用者應自期滿六個月前起算五個月之期間內申請核准展延，每次展延不得超過五年","有效期間為三年，期滿仍繼續使用者應自期滿三個月前起算二個月之期間內申請核准展延，每次展延不得超過三年","有效期間為十年，期滿仍繼續使用者應自期滿一年前起算六個月之期間內申請核准展延，每次展延不得超過十年","有效期間為五年，期滿仍繼續使用者應於期滿後三十日內補行申請核准展延，每次展延不得超過二年並以一次為限"],"a",
 "第15條第1項：排放許可證及簡易排放許可文件之有效期間為五年；期滿仍繼續使用者，應自期滿六個月前起算五個月之期間內申請核准展延，每次展延不得超過五年。第2項：有效期間內因水質惡化有危害之虞時，主管機關應變更許可事項或廢止之。比較第32條土壤處理許可證有效期間為三年。",
 "How long are discharge permits valid and when must renewal be sought?",
 ["Five years; renewal must be applied for within the five month window beginning six months before expiry, and each renewal may not exceed five years","Three years; renewal must be applied for within the two month window beginning three months before expiry, and each renewal may not exceed three years","Ten years; renewal must be applied for within the six month window beginning one year before expiry, and each renewal may not exceed ten years","Five years; renewal may be applied for within thirty days after expiry, and each renewal may not exceed two years and is allowed only once"],
 "Article 15, paragraph 1; compare Article 32 (three years for soil treatment permits)."),

(W,"第16條",2,"水污法-不明排放管",
 "事業廢（污）水利用不明排放管排放者，主管機關應如何處理？",
 ["由主管機關公告廢止，經公告一週尚無人認領者，得予以封閉或排除該排放管線","由主管機關公告廢止，經公告三個月尚無人認領者，始得予以封閉或排除管線","由主管機關逕行拆除該管線，並於拆除後一週內公告，通知管線所有人領回","由主管機關函請目的事業主管機關查明，於查明前不得封閉或排除該排放管線"],"a",
 "第16條：事業廢（污）水利用不明排放管排放者，由主管機關公告廢止，經公告一週尚無人認領者，得予以封閉或排除該排放管線。第18條之1並禁止繞流排放，違者依第46條之1處罰。",
 "How does the authority deal with discharge through an unidentified pipe?",
 ["It announces abolition of the pipe, and if nobody claims it within one week it may seal or remove that discharge pipeline","It announces abolition of the pipe, and only if nobody claims it within three months may it seal or remove the pipeline","It removes the pipeline directly and announces this within one week afterwards, notifying the owner to collect the pipe","It asks the industry competent authority to investigate, and may not seal or remove the pipeline before that is done"],
 "Article 16."),

(W,"第17條",3,"水污法-技師簽證",
 "事業申請水污染防治措施計畫或排放許可時，必要文件應經何人簽證？何種情形得免簽證？",
 ["應經依法登記執業之環境工程技師或其他相關專業技師簽證；納入污水下水道系統者，或已核准計畫中應簽證事項未變更、展延時簽證事項未變更者得免","應經主管機關指定之檢驗測定機構負責人簽證；凡屬中小企業或用水量未達每日一百立方公尺者，均得免經任何簽證程序逕行提出申請","應經廢水處理專責人員及事業負責人共同簽證；凡屬已取得環境管理系統驗證之事業，其全部申請文件均得免經技師或專責人員簽證","應經目的事業主管機關指派之技正核章；凡屬公營事業或政府機關者一律免簽證，私人事業則不論任何情形均應逐案辦理技師簽證"],"a",
 "第17條第1項：除納入污水下水道系統者外，依第13條檢具計畫及依第14條申請許可或變更登記時，必要文件應經依法登記執業之環境工程技師或其他相關專業技師簽證。第2項列舉二種免再簽證情形：依第14條申請許可時應簽證事項與已核准計畫未變更者，及依第15條申請展延時應簽證事項未變更者。第3項政府機關、公營事業機構或公法人得由內部具技師證書者辦理簽證。",
 "Who must certify the documents, and when is certification exempted?",
 ["A licensed environmental engineering or related professional engineer; exempt for sewer connection, or where certified items are unchanged from the approved plan or on renewal","The head of a testing organisation designated by the authority; small and medium enterprises or those using under one hundred cubic metres daily are wholly exempt","The dedicated wastewater personnel together with the responsible person; enterprises holding environmental management system certification are exempt for all documents","A senior technician assigned by the industry authority; public enterprises and government agencies are always exempt while private ones are never exempt in any case"],
 "Article 17, paragraphs 1 to 3."),

(W,"第18條",1,"水污法-防治措施辦法",
 "事業水污染防治措施之管理辦法由何機關訂定？其內容包括哪些事項？",
 ["由中央主管機關會商相關目的事業主管機關定之；內容包括適用對象、範圍、條件、必備設施、規格、設置、操作、監測、記錄及紀錄保存年限等","由直轄市、縣（市）主管機關分別定之並報中央備查；內容包括適用對象、範圍、條件、必備設施、規格、設置、操作、監測及紀錄保存年限等事項","由各目的事業主管機關會商中央主管機關定之；內容限於必備設施之規格與設置方式，操作、監測、記錄及緊急應變事項則由事業自行訂定管理","由中央主管機關報請立法院審議後公告；內容包括適用對象、範圍、條件與必備設施，但不得涉及廢（污）水之收集、處理及排放等事項"],"a",
 "第18條：事業應採行水污染防治措施；其適用對象、範圍、條件、必備設施、規格、設置、操作、監測、記錄、監測紀錄資料保存年限、預防管理、緊急應變，與廢（污）水之收集、處理、排放及其他應遵行事項之管理辦法，由中央主管機關會商相關目的事業主管機關定之。違反者依第46條處罰。",
 "Who issues the regulations on water pollution control measures, and what do they cover?",
 ["The central authority in consultation with industry authorities; covering applicable targets, scope, conditions, required facilities, specifications, installation, operation, monitoring, records and retention","Municipal and county authorities separately, filed with the centre; covering applicable targets, scope, conditions, required facilities, specifications, installation, operation, monitoring and retention","Industry authorities in consultation with the central authority; limited to facility specifications and installation, with operation, monitoring, records and emergency response left to enterprises","The central authority after Legislative Yuan review; covering targets, scope, conditions and required facilities but never the collection, treatment or discharge of wastewater"],
 "Article 18; penalties under Article 46."),

(W,"第18條之1",3,"水污法-繞流排放",
 "事業或污水下水道系統產生之廢（污）水應由何處排放？可否稀釋？",
 ["應經核准登記之收集、處理單元、流程，並由核准登記之放流口排放或依核准排入污水下水道，不得繞流排放；須處理始能符合標準者不得於排放前與無需處理之水混合稀釋","得選擇任一放流口排放，僅須事後於申報時載明實際使用之放流口；為使水質穩定，得於排放前與冷卻水或雨水混合稀釋，不受任何限制亦無須申請許可","應由核准登記之放流口排放，但情況急迫時得任意繞流排放而無須通知主管機關；經稀釋後符合放流水標準者，視為已符合本法所定之各項管制標準","應由核准登記之放流口排放，繞流排放須事先取得目的事業主管機關同意；稀釋行為僅在稀釋倍數未達二倍時免申請許可，超過者應報請中央核准"],"a",
 "第18條之1第1項、第2項：廢（污）水應經核准登記之收集、處理單元、流程，並由核准登記之放流口排放，或依下水道管理機關（構）核准之排放口排入污水下水道，不得繞流排放；須經處理始能符合管制標準者，不得於排放（入）前與無需處理即能符合標準之水混合稀釋。第4項並要求處理設施具備足夠功能與設備並維持正常操作。違反者依第46條之1處罰。",
 "Where must wastewater be discharged, and may it be diluted?",
 ["Only through approved collection and treatment units and the registered outlet or an approved sewer inlet, with no bypass; water needing treatment may not be diluted with clean water before discharge","Through any outlet chosen, provided the one actually used is stated when reporting; dilution with cooling water or rainwater before discharge is unrestricted and needs no permit","Through the registered outlet, but in any urgent situation bypass discharge is freely allowed without notifying the authority at all; effluent that meets the standards after dilution counts as compliant","Through the registered outlet, with bypass allowed on prior consent of the industry authority; dilution under two fold needs no permit while higher ratios need central approval"],
 "Article 18-1, paragraphs 1, 2 and 4; penalties under Article 46-1."),

(W,"第18條之1",2,"水污法-繞流例外",
 "繞流排放及稀釋行為在何種情形下不受禁止規定之限制？",
 ["因情況急迫，為搶救人員或經主管機關認定之重大處理設施，並於三小時內通知直轄市、縣（市）主管機關者","因設備維修或定期歲修需要，並於事後七日內以書面報告當地主管機關說明繞流之原因、時間及水量者","因假日或夜間無專責人員在場，且繞流水量未超過當日總排放量百分之十，並記載於操作紀錄簿者","因颱風豪雨導致處理設施負荷過大，於繞流開始前向目的事業主管機關報備並取得同意函者"],"a",
 "第18條之1第3項：前二項繞流排放、稀釋行為，因情況急迫，為搶救人員或經主管機關認定之重大處理設施，並於三小時內通知直轄市、縣（市）主管機關者，不在此限。此三小時通知期限與第27條第1項、第28條第1項之緊急通知期限相同。",
 "When are bypass discharge and dilution not caught by the prohibition?",
 ["Where the situation is urgent, to rescue personnel or major treatment facilities recognised by the authority, and the local authority is notified within three hours","Where equipment repair or scheduled overhaul requires it, and a written report on cause, duration and volume reaches the local authority within seven days","Where no dedicated personnel are present at night or on holidays, the bypass is under ten percent of daily discharge, and it is noted in the operating log","Where typhoon rainfall overloads the treatment facility, and the industry competent authority is notified and consents before the bypass begins"],
 "Article 18-1, paragraph 3; same three hour rule as Articles 27 and 28."),

(W,"第19條",1,"水污法-準用規定",
 "污水下水道系統排放廢（污）水，準用本法哪些條文之規定？",
 ["準用第十四條、第十五條及第十八條之規定，即排放許可、許可有效期間與水污染防治措施等規定","準用第七條、第八條及第九條之規定，即放流水標準、污泥處理與總量管制方式等相關規定","準用第二十六條、第二十七條及第二十八條之規定，即查證工作與緊急應變通知等相關規定","準用第三十二條、第三十三條之規定，即土壤處理許可與貯存指定物質防止污染地下水體規定"],"a",
 "第19條：污水下水道系統排放廢（污）水，準用第十四條、第十五條及第十八條之規定。違反第19條者依第47條處新臺幣六萬元以上六百萬元以下罰鍰，並通知限期補正或改善，屆期未補正或完成改善者按次處罰。",
 "Which articles apply mutatis mutandis to discharge by a sewer system?",
 ["Articles 14, 15 and 18, that is discharge permits, permit validity and water pollution control measures","Articles 7, 8 and 9, that is effluent standards, sludge handling and the total load control mechanism","Articles 26, 27 and 28, that is inspection powers and emergency response notification requirements","Articles 32 and 33, that is soil treatment permits and facilities preventing groundwater contamination"],
 "Article 19; penalties under Article 47."),

(W,"第20條",2,"水污法-貯留稀釋許可",
 "事業或污水下水道系統貯留或稀釋廢水應辦理何程序？申請稀釋許可有何限制？",
 ["應申請直轄市或縣（市）主管機關許可後始得為之並依登記事項運作；申請稀釋廢水許可以無其他可行之替代方法者為限","應申請中央主管機關許可後始得為之並依登記事項運作；申請稀釋廢水許可以稀釋後水質可符合放流水標準者為限","應向目的事業主管機關報備後即得為之並自行留存紀錄；申請稀釋廢水許可以貯留容量未超過每日排放量者為限","應由環境工程技師簽證後即得為之並按季申報一次；申請稀釋廢水許可以事業設有自動監測系統者為限"],"a",
 "第20條第1項：事業或污水下水道系統貯留或稀釋廢水，應申請直轄市或縣（市）主管機關許可後，始得為之，並依登記事項運作；但申請稀釋廢水許可，以無其他可行之替代方法者為限。第3項並應依規定格式、內容、頻率、方式申報廢水處理情形。未取得許可而貯留或稀釋者依第48條第1項處罰並應令全部停工或停業。",
 "What procedure applies to storing or diluting wastewater, and what limits dilution permits?",
 ["A permit from the municipal or county authority is required first and operation must follow the registration; a dilution permit is granted only where no other feasible alternative exists","A permit from the central authority is required first and operation must follow the registration; a dilution permit is granted only where the diluted water would meet effluent standards","Filing with the industry competent authority suffices and records are kept in house; a dilution permit is granted only where storage capacity is below the daily discharge volume","Engineer certification suffices and quarterly reporting follows; a dilution permit is granted only to enterprises that have installed automatic monitoring systems"],
 "Article 20, paragraphs 1 and 3; penalties under Article 48."),

(W,"第21條",1,"水污法-專責人員",
 "事業或污水下水道系統就廢（污）水處理有何人員設置義務？相關管理辦法由何機關訂定？",
 ["應設置廢（污）水處理專責單位或人員；其設置及資格、訓練、合格證書取得等管理辦法由中央主管機關定之","應設置環境影響評估專責小組；其設置及資格、訓練、合格證書取得等管理辦法由目的事業主管機關定之","應設置勞工安全衛生管理單位兼辦；其設置及資格、訓練、合格證書取得等管理辦法由勞動部會商中央定之","應委託環境工程技師事務所常駐辦理；其設置及資格、訓練、合格證書取得等管理辦法由地方主管機關定之"],"a",
 "第21條：事業或污水下水道系統應設置廢（污）水處理專責單位或人員；專責單位或人員之設置及專責人員之資格、訓練、合格證書之取得、撤銷、廢止及其他應遵行事項之管理辦法，由中央主管機關定之。違反者依第48條第3項、第4項處新臺幣一萬元以上十萬元以下罰鍰。",
 "What personnel must be provided, and who issues the related regulations?",
 ["A dedicated wastewater treatment unit or personnel; the central authority issues regulations on their establishment, qualifications, training and certificates","A dedicated environmental impact assessment team; the industry competent authority issues regulations on establishment, qualifications, training and certificates","An occupational safety and health unit doubling in the role; the Ministry of Labor with the centre issues regulations on establishment, qualifications and certificates","A resident engineer from a commissioned consulting firm; the local competent authority issues regulations on establishment, qualifications, training and certificates"],
 "Article 21; penalties under Article 48, paragraphs 3 and 4."),

(W,"第22條",2,"水污法-申報義務",
 "事業或污水下水道系統應向何機關申報哪些文件？應檢測申報項目由何機關訂定？",
 ["應向直轄市、縣（市）主管機關申報處理設施操作、放流水水質水量檢驗測定、用電紀錄等文件；中央主管機關依各業別廢水特性訂定應檢測申報項目","應向中央主管機關申報處理設施操作、放流水水質水量檢驗測定、用電紀錄等文件；直轄市、縣（市）主管機關依各業別廢水特性訂定應檢測申報項目","應向目的事業主管機關申報處理設施操作及用水量、產能等文件；應檢測申報項目由事業委託之檢驗測定機構依實際排放情形自行決定並報備","應向當地鄉鎮市公所申報放流水水質水量檢驗測定結果；應檢測申報項目由該事業所屬公會會商目的事業主管機關訂定後公告實施"],"a",
 "第22條第1項：事業或污水下水道系統應依主管機關規定之格式、內容、頻率、方式，向直轄市、縣（市）主管機關申報廢（污）水處理設施之操作、放流水水質水量之檢驗測定、用電紀錄及其他有關文件。第2項：中央主管機關應依各業別廢（污）水特性訂定應檢測申報項目，地方主管機關得增加項目。不為申報者依第56條處罰。",
 "To whom must reports be filed, and who sets the items to be tested and reported?",
 ["To the local authority, covering facility operation, effluent quality and quantity testing and power use records; the central authority sets reporting items by industry wastewater characteristics","To the central authority, covering facility operation, effluent quality and quantity testing and power use records; local authorities set reporting items by industry wastewater characteristics","To the industry competent authority, covering facility operation, water use and output; the commissioned testing organisation decides the reporting items by actual discharge","To the township office, covering effluent quality and quantity test results; the trade association sets reporting items with the industry authority and announces them"],
 "Article 22; penalties under Article 56."),

(W,"第23條",2,"水污法-檢驗測定機構",
 "水污染物及水質水量之檢驗測定應委託何種機構辦理？",
 ["除經中央主管機關核准外，應委託中央主管機關核發許可證之檢驗測定機構辦理","除經地方主管機關核准外，應委託目的事業主管機關登記有案之顧問機構辦理","一律應由事業自行設置實驗室辦理，不得委託任何外部之檢驗測定機構辦理","應委託經濟部標準檢驗局認證之實驗室辦理，中央主管機關不得另設許可制度"],"a",
 "第23條第1項：水污染物及水質水量之檢驗測定，除經中央主管機關核准外，應委託中央主管機關核發許可證之檢驗測定機構辦理。第2項：檢驗測定機構之條件、設施、人員資格、許可證申請、審查、核發、撤銷、廢止等管理辦法及收費標準由中央主管機關定之。違反者依第49條處新臺幣三萬元以上三百萬元以下罰鍰。",
 "Which organisations may perform testing of water pollutants and water quality and quantity?",
 ["Unless approved by the central authority, testing must be commissioned to organisations licensed by the central authority","Unless approved by the local authority, testing must be commissioned to consultancies registered with the industry authority","Enterprises must always run their own laboratories and may never commission any external testing organisation","Testing must go to laboratories accredited by the Bureau of Standards, the central authority setting no licence system"],
 "Article 23; penalties under Article 49."),

(W,"第24條",1,"水污法-輔導",
 "事業或污水下水道系統廢（污）水處理及排放之改善，由何機關輔導？輔導辦法由何機關訂定？",
 ["由各目的事業主管機關輔導之，其輔導辦法由各目的事業主管機關定之","由中央主管機關輔導之，其輔導辦法由行政院會商立法院共同定之","由直轄市、縣（市）主管機關輔導之，其輔導辦法由中央主管機關定之","由中央主管機關委託之專責機構輔導，輔導辦法由該專責機構自訂"],"a",
 "第24條：事業或污水下水道系統，其廢（污）水處理及排放之改善，由各目的事業主管機關輔導之；其輔導辦法，由各目的事業主管機關定之。此與第4條主管機關得委託專責機構辦理研究訓練防治事宜不同。",
 "Who provides guidance on improving wastewater treatment and discharge, and who issues the rules?",
 ["The respective industry competent authorities provide guidance, and each issues its own guidance regulations","The central competent authority provides guidance, with rules set by the Executive and Legislative Yuan jointly","Municipal and county authorities provide guidance, with the guidance regulations issued by the central authority","An institution commissioned by the central authority guides, and that institution writes its own rules"],
 "Article 24."),

(W,"第25條",2,"水污法-建築物污水設施",
 "建築物污水處理設施應由何人清理？屬預鑄式者其管理辦法由何機關訂定？",
 ["由所有人、使用人或管理人自行或委託清除機構清理；預鑄式者之製造、審定、登記及查驗管理辦法由中央主管機關會同相關目的事業主管機關定之","由當地鄉鎮市公所編列預算統一清理；預鑄式者之製造、審定、登記及查驗管理辦法由直轄市、縣（市）主管機關會商建築主管機關分別定之","由污水下水道機構負責定期清理並收取費用；預鑄式者之製造、審定、登記及查驗管理辦法由內政部營建署會商中央主管機關共同訂定公告","由建築物之起造人負責終身清理維護；預鑄式者之製造、審定、登記及查驗管理辦法由該產品之製造廠商依國家標準自行訂定並報備查"],"a",
 "第25條：建築物污水處理設施之所有人、使用人或管理人，應自行或委託清除機構清理之；其建造、管理及清理應符合中央主管機關及目的事業主管機關之規定；屬預鑄式者，其製造、審定、登記及查驗管理辦法，由中央主管機關會同相關目的事業主管機關定之。違反第7條第1項或第8條者依第41條處新臺幣三千元以上三十萬元以下罰鍰。",
 "Who must clean building sewage treatment facilities, and who regulates prefabricated ones?",
 ["The owner, user or manager, personally or through a cleaning organisation; the central authority with relevant industry authorities regulates manufacture, approval, registration and inspection","The township office, cleaning them all under its own budget; local authorities with building authorities separately regulate manufacture, approval, registration and inspection","The sewerage undertaking, cleaning them periodically for a fee; the Construction and Planning Agency with the central authority jointly regulates manufacture and inspection","The original building developer, for the whole life of the building; the product manufacturer sets its own rules on manufacture, approval, registration and inspection under national standards"],
 "Article 25; penalties under Article 41."),

(W,"第26條",2,"水污法-查證工作",
 "主管機關派員進入場所得為哪些查證工作？受檢者及檢查人員各有何義務？",
 ["得檢查污染物來源及廢（污）水處理排放情形、索取有關資料、採樣、流量測定及攝影；受檢者不得規避妨礙拒絕，檢查人員對工商軍事秘密應予保密","得檢查污染物來源及索取資料，但不得採樣、測流量或攝影；受檢者得以涉及營業秘密為由拒絕受檢，檢查人員則無保密義務僅須遵守一般公務規範","得檢查污染物來源、索取資料並逕行查封生產設備；受檢者不得規避妨礙拒絕，檢查人員對於受檢之工商與軍事秘密均得對外公開以促進資訊透明","得於取得法院搜索票後檢查污染物來源並採樣攝影；受檢者得於七日內申請覆檢，檢查人員對於受檢之工商秘密應予保密但軍事秘密不在此限"],"a",
 "第26條第1項列舉三款查證工作：檢查污染物來源及廢（污）水處理、排放情形；索取有關資料；採樣、流量測定及有關廢（污）水處理、排放情形之攝影。第3項受檢者不得規避、妨礙或拒絕，第4項檢查機關與人員對受檢之工商、軍事秘密應予保密。規避妨礙拒絕者依第50條處新臺幣三萬元以上三百萬元以下罰鍰並得按次處罰。",
 "What inspection work may officials perform, and what duties fall on each side?",
 ["Checking pollutant sources and treatment and discharge, obtaining data, sampling, flow measurement and photography; the inspected may not evade, and inspectors must keep trade and military secrets","Checking pollutant sources and obtaining data only, without sampling, flow measurement or photography; the inspected may refuse citing trade secrets, and inspectors owe no confidentiality duty","Checking pollutant sources, obtaining data and sealing production equipment directly; the inspected may not evade, and inspectors may publicise trade and military secrets for transparency","Checking pollutant sources, sampling and photographing after obtaining a court warrant; the inspected may seek re-inspection within seven days, and only trade secrets are protected"],
 "Article 26; penalties under Article 50."),

(W,"第27條",2,"水污法-緊急應變",
 "排放廢（污）水有嚴重危害人體健康、農漁業生產或飲用水水源之虞時，負責人應如何處理？",
 ["負責人應立即採取緊急應變措施，並於三小時內通知當地主管機關；主管機關應命其採取必要防治措施，情節嚴重者並令停業或部分或全部停工","負責人應於二十四小時內採取應變措施並通知當地主管機關；主管機關僅得命其限期改善，不得令其停業或停工以免影響事業之營運與員工生計","負責人應立即停止排放並於七日內以書面通知中央主管機關；主管機關應先函請目的事業主管機關表示意見後，始得命其採取必要之防治措施","負責人應通報消防機關到場處理並於事後三十日內申報；主管機關應待檢測結果確認危害成立後，始得命其採取必要防治措施或令其停工"],"a",
 "第27條第1項：事業或污水下水道系統排放廢（污）水有嚴重危害人體健康、農漁業生產或飲用水水源之虞時，負責人應立即採取緊急應變措施，並於三小時內通知當地主管機關。第4項主管機關應命其採取必要防治措施，情節嚴重者並令停業或停工。違反第1項、第4項者依第51條第1項處新臺幣六萬元以上六百萬元以下罰鍰；未立即採取應變措施或不遵行命令者另依第34條負刑事責任。",
 "What must the responsible person do when discharge risks serious harm to health, farming or drinking water sources?",
 ["Take emergency response measures immediately and notify the local authority within three hours; the authority orders necessary measures and, in serious cases, suspension of business or operations","Take response measures and notify the local authority within twenty four hours; the authority may only order improvement within a deadline and never suspend business or operations","Stop discharging immediately and notify the central authority in writing within seven days; the authority must first seek the industry authority's views before ordering any measures","Notify the fire authority to attend the scene and file a report within thirty days afterwards; the authority may order necessary measures or suspension only after test results confirm that harm has occurred"],
 "Article 27; penalties under Articles 51 and 34."),

(W,"第28條",2,"水污法-設備疏漏",
 "輸送或貯存設備有疏漏污染物或廢（污）水至水體之虞者，事業應如何處理？實際疏漏致污染水體時呢？",
 ["有疏漏之虞者應採取維護及防範措施；有疏漏致污染水體者應立即採取緊急應變措施，並於事故發生後三小時內通知當地主管機關","有疏漏之虞者應立即停止使用該設備；有疏漏致污染水體者應於事故發生後二十四小時內通知當地主管機關並提出書面報告","有疏漏之虞者應報請主管機關派員檢查；有疏漏致污染水體者應於事故發生後七日內通知當地主管機關並檢送檢測結果","有疏漏之虞者應加強巡查頻率並留存紀錄；有疏漏致污染水體者應於當月申報時一併載明疏漏原因及採行之防治措施"],"a",
 "第28條第1項：事業或污水下水道系統設置之輸送或貯存設備，有疏漏污染物或廢（污）水至水體之虞者，應採取維護及防範措施；其有疏漏致污染水體者，應立即採取緊急應變措施，並於事故發生後三小時內通知當地主管機關；主管機關應命其採取必要之防治措施，情節嚴重者並令停業或停工。違反者依第51條第2項處新臺幣一萬元以上六百萬元以下罰鍰。",
 "What must be done where conveyance or storage equipment risks leaking, and where leakage actually pollutes water?",
 ["Where leakage is feared, maintenance and preventive measures; where leakage pollutes water, immediate emergency response and notice to the local authority within three hours of the incident","Where leakage is feared, immediate suspension of the equipment; where leakage pollutes water, notice to the local authority within twenty four hours with a written report","Where leakage is feared, a request for the authority to send inspectors; where leakage pollutes water, notice to the local authority within seven days with test results","Where leakage is feared, more frequent patrols with inspection records kept on file; where leakage pollutes water, a note of the cause and the measures taken in that month's routine report"],
 "Article 28; penalties under Article 51, paragraph 2."),

(W,"第29條",1,"水污法-管制區劃定",
 "水污染管制區由何機關劃定公告？涉及二直轄市、縣（市）以上者如何處理？",
 ["由直轄市、縣（市）主管機關視轄境內水污染狀況劃定公告並報中央主管機關；涉及二直轄市、縣（市）以上者由中央主管機關劃定並公告","由中央主管機關視全國水污染狀況統一劃定公告；涉及二直轄市、縣（市）以上者由該二地方主管機關協商劃定後報中央主管機關備查","由目的事業主管機關視產業分布狀況劃定公告；涉及二直轄市、縣（市）以上者由流域面積較大之一方主管機關劃定並通知他方配合","由行政院視國土計畫需要劃定公告；涉及二直轄市、縣（市）以上者由中央主管機關報請立法院同意後劃定，並於公告後三十日生效"],"a",
 "第29條：直轄市、縣（市）主管機關得視轄境內水污染狀況，劃定水污染管制區公告之，並報中央主管機關；管制區涉及二直轄市、縣（市）以上者，由中央主管機關劃定並公告之。第30條規定管制區內之禁止行為，違反者依第52條處罰。",
 "Who delimits and announces water pollution control zones, and what if two jurisdictions are involved?",
 ["Local authorities delimit and announce them by local pollution conditions and report to the centre; where two or more jurisdictions are involved the central authority does so","The central authority delimits and announces them uniformly nationwide; where two or more jurisdictions are involved the localities negotiate and file the result centrally","Industry authorities delimit and announce them by industrial distribution; where two or more jurisdictions are involved the one with the larger basin delimits and notifies the other","The Executive Yuan delimits and announces them for spatial planning; where two or more jurisdictions are involved the centre acts with Legislative Yuan consent, effective in thirty days"],
 "Article 29; prohibited acts in Article 30."),

(W,"第30條",2,"水污法-管制區禁止行為",
 "在水污染管制區內，下列何者屬本法明文禁止之行為？",
 ["使用農藥或化學肥料致有污染指定水體之虞、在水體或沿岸規定距離內棄置垃圾水肥污泥酸鹼廢液建築廢料、使用毒品藥品或電流捕殺水生物","在水體內從事游泳、垂釣或划船等水域遊憩活動、於沿岸架設觀景平臺或步道、於水體上空施放無人機從事空拍或測繪等各類作業行為","於水體沿岸種植水生植物或設置人工濕地、於水體中放流魚苗或蝦苗、於沿岸設置水質自動監測站及採樣平臺等監測設施之行為","於水體取水供灌溉或工業使用、於沿岸開闢農地或魚塭、於水體中設置攔河堰或抽水站等水利設施及其附屬構造物之行為"],"a",
 "第30條第1項各款禁止行為包括：使用農藥或化學肥料致有污染指定水體之虞；在水體或其沿岸規定距離內棄置垃圾、水肥、污泥、酸鹼廢液、建築廢料或其他污染物；使用毒品、藥品或電流捕殺水生物；在指定水體或沿岸規定距離內飼養家禽家畜；其他經主管機關公告禁止足使水污染之行為。違反者依第52條處新臺幣三萬元以上三百萬元以下罰鍰。",
 "Which of these is expressly prohibited inside a water pollution control zone?",
 ["Using pesticides or fertiliser risking pollution of designated waters, dumping refuse, night soil, sludge, acid or alkaline waste or construction debris, and killing aquatic life with poison or electricity","Swimming, angling or boating for recreation in the water body, building viewing decks or walking trails along the bank, and flying drones over the water for aerial photography or mapping survey work","Planting aquatic vegetation or creating artificial wetlands along the bank, releasing fish or shrimp fry, and installing automatic monitoring stations and sampling platforms","Abstracting water for irrigation or industry, opening farmland or fish ponds along the bank, and building weirs or pumping stations and their ancillary structures"],
 "Article 30, paragraph 1; penalties under Article 52."),

(W,"第30條",2,"水污法-指定水體距離",
 "第30條所稱指定水體及規定距離，由何機關認定公告？",
 ["由主管機關視實際需要公告之，但中央主管機關另有規定者從其規定","由中央主管機關統一公告之，地方主管機關不得另行公告任何範圍","由目的事業主管機關會商農田水利會公告，中央主管機關不得介入","由當地鄉鎮市民代表會決議後公告，並報請直轄市縣市政府備查"],"a",
 "第30條第2項：第一項第一款（使用農藥化學肥料）、第二款（棄置污染物）及第四款（飼養家禽家畜）所稱指定水體及規定距離，由主管機關視實際需要公告之；但中央主管機關另有規定者，從其規定。",
 "Who announces the designated water bodies and prescribed distances under Article 30?",
 ["The competent authority announces them as actually needed, unless the central authority has provided otherwise","The central authority announces them uniformly, and no local authority may announce any range of its own","The industry authority announces them with irrigation associations, the central authority having no power to intervene","The local township representative council resolves and announces them, filing the result with the county government"],
 "Article 30, paragraph 2."),

(W,"第31條",3,"水污法-自動監測",
 "排放廢（污）水於總量管制水體者，在何種情形應自行設置放流水水質水量自動監測系統？",
 ["排放廢（污）水量每日超過一千立方公尺者，或經直轄市、縣（市）主管機關認定係重大水污染源者","排放廢（污）水量每日超過一百立方公尺者，或該事業之資本額達新臺幣一億元以上並僱用員工百人以上者","排放廢（污）水量每年超過一千立方公尺者，或經目的事業主管機關認定屬高污染潛勢之特定製程業別者","排放廢（污）水量每日超過五千立方公尺者，或該事業曾於最近三年內因違反放流水標準受罰鍰處分二次者"],"a",
 "第31條第1項：事業或污水下水道系統排放廢（污）水於劃定為總量管制之水體，排放量每日超過一千立方公尺，或經直轄市、縣（市）主管機關認定係重大水污染源者，應自行設置放流水水質水量自動監測系統。第2項監測結果及儀器校正應作成紀錄並申報。違反第1項者依第52條處罰，未依第2項申報者依第56條處罰。",
 "When must an automatic effluent monitoring system be installed for discharge into a total load control water body?",
 ["Where daily wastewater discharge exceeds one thousand cubic metres, or the local authority has found the source to be a major water pollution source","Where daily wastewater discharge exceeds one hundred cubic metres, or the enterprise has capital of one hundred million and over one hundred employees","Where annual wastewater discharge exceeds one thousand cubic metres, or the industry authority has classed the process as one of high pollution potential","Where daily wastewater discharge exceeds five thousand cubic metres, or the enterprise has been fined twice in three years for breaching effluent standards"],
 "Article 31; penalties under Articles 52 and 56."),

(W,"第32條",2,"水污法-土壤處理",
 "廢（污）水可否注入地下水體或排放於土壤？例外要件為何？",
 ["原則不得注入地下水體或排放於土壤；但經處理至合於土壤處理標準及依第十八條所定辦法，經地方主管機關審查核准發給許可證並報經中央主管機關核備者，得排放於土壤","原則不得注入地下水體；但排放於土壤者不受限制，僅須事後向地方主管機關申報排放量、排放位置及水質檢測結果，並留存紀錄三年備查即可","原則不得排放於土壤；但注入地下水體者經目的事業主管機關同意即可，並應於注入前完成地下水水質背景調查及作物吸收試驗後報中央核備","原則上二者均得為之；但應先取得環境影響評估審查結論並經該筆土地所有權人書面同意，且所注入之水質尚須符合地下水污染管制標準所定之各項限值規定"],"a",
 "第32條第1項：廢（污）水不得注入於地下水體或排放於土壤；但經處理至合於土壤處理標準及依第十八條所定之辦法，經直轄市、縣（市）主管機關審查核准發給許可證並報經中央主管機關核備者，得排放於土壤。第3項土壤處理標準由中央主管機關會商相關目的事業主管機關定之。違反者依第53條處罰，注入地下水體含有害健康物質者另依第36條第2項負刑責。",
 "May wastewater be injected into groundwater or discharged to soil, and what is the exception?",
 ["Neither is allowed in principle; but discharge to soil is allowed where treated to the soil treatment standard and the rules under Article 18, permitted by the local authority and filed centrally","Injection into groundwater is barred in principle; discharge to soil is unrestricted, needing only later reporting of volume, location and test results with records kept three years","Discharge to soil is barred in principle; injection into groundwater is allowed on industry authority consent, after background groundwater survey and crop uptake tests filed centrally","Both are allowed in principle, subject to an environmental impact assessment conclusion, the landowner's written consent, and compliance with groundwater control standard limits"],
 "Article 32, paragraphs 1 and 3; penalties under Articles 53 and 36."),

(W,"第32條",2,"水污法-土壤許可期限",
 "依第32條核發之排放土壤處理許可證有效期間為何？展延如何辦理？",
 ["有效期間為三年，期滿仍繼續使用者應自期滿六個月前起算五個月之期間內申請核准展延，每次展延不得超過三年","有效期間為五年，期滿仍繼續使用者應自期滿六個月前起算五個月之期間內申請核准展延，每次展延不得超過五年","有效期間為三年，期滿仍繼續使用者應於期滿前一個月內申請核准展延，每次展延不得超過一年並以二次為限","有效期間為十年，期滿仍繼續使用者應自期滿一年前起算六個月之期間內申請核准展延，每次展延不得超過十年"],"a",
 "第32條第5項：依第一項核發之許可證有效期間為三年；期滿仍繼續使用者，應自期滿六個月前起算五個月之期間內，向直轄市、縣（市）主管機關申請核准展延，每次展延不得超過三年。相較之下，第15條排放許可證有效期間為五年，展延每次不得超過五年，申請窗口期間相同。",
 "How long is a soil discharge treatment permit valid, and how is it renewed?",
 ["Three years; renewal must be sought within the five month window beginning six months before expiry, and each renewal may not exceed three years","Five years; renewal must be sought within the five month window beginning six months before expiry, and each renewal may not exceed five years","Three years; renewal must be sought within the last month before expiry, and each renewal may not exceed one year and is allowed only twice","Ten years; renewal must be sought within the six month window beginning one year before expiry, and each renewal may not exceed ten years"],
 "Article 32, paragraph 5; compare Article 15."),

(W,"第33條",2,"水污法-貯存指定物質",
 "事業貯存經中央主管機關公告指定之物質時，應辦理何事項？",
 ["應設置防止污染地下水體之設施及監測設備，並經直轄市、縣（市）主管機關備查後始得申辦有關使用事宜","應設置圍堵設施及消防設備，並經目的事業主管機關核准後始得貯存，監測設備得視貯存量多寡自行決定設置","應投保公共意外責任保險並提列整治基金，經中央主管機關核准後始得貯存，無須另設監測設備或防污設施","應委託檢驗測定機構每月採樣一次並申報，經環保稽查大隊查核合格後始得貯存，防污設施由主管機關代設"],"a",
 "第33條第1項：事業貯存經中央主管機關公告指定之物質時，應設置防止污染地下水體之設施及監測設備，並經直轄市、縣（市）主管機關備查後，始得申辦有關使用事宜。第2項監測設備應依規定監測、記錄及申報。違反第1項、第2項者依第54條處新臺幣六萬元以上六百萬元以下罰鍰，情節重大者得令停止貯存或停工、停業。",
 "What must an enterprise do when storing substances designated by the central authority?",
 ["Install facilities preventing groundwater contamination and monitoring equipment, and obtain local authority recordation before applying for use related matters","Install containment and fire fighting equipment and obtain industry authority approval before storing, deciding on monitoring equipment by the volume stored","Take out public liability insurance and set aside a remediation fund with central approval before storing, needing no monitoring or pollution prevention facilities","Commission monthly sampling and reporting by a testing organisation and pass an inspection brigade audit, the authority installing the prevention facilities"],
 "Article 33; penalties under Article 54."),

(W,"第34條",3,"水污法-刑責",
 "未立即採取緊急應變措施或不遵行主管機關停工停業命令者，應負何刑事責任？不遵行停止作為命令者呢？",
 ["處三年以下有期徒刑、拘役或科或併科新臺幣二十萬元以上五百萬元以下罰金；不遵行停止作為命令者處一年以下有期徒刑、拘役或科或併科十萬元以上五十萬元以下罰金","處五年以下有期徒刑、拘役或科或併科新臺幣三十萬元以上八百萬元以下罰金；不遵行停止作為命令者處二年以下有期徒刑、拘役或科或併科二十萬元以上一百萬元以下罰金","處一年以下有期徒刑、拘役或科或併科新臺幣六萬元以上一百萬元以下罰金；不遵行停止作為命令者處拘役或科或併科新臺幣三萬元以上三十萬元以下罰金並得按次處罰","處七年以上有期徒刑並得併科新臺幣三千萬元以下罰金；不遵行停止作為命令者處三年以上十年以下有期徒刑，並得併科新臺幣二千五百萬元以下罰金"],"a",
 "第34條第1項：違反第27條第1項、第28條第1項未立即採取緊急應變措施，或不遵行主管機關依第27條第4項、第28條第1項所為之命令，或不遵行停工停業命令者，處三年以下有期徒刑、拘役或科或併科新臺幣二十萬元以上五百萬元以下罰金。第2項：不遵行停止作為之命令者，處一年以下有期徒刑、拘役或科或併科新臺幣十萬元以上五十萬元以下罰金。第36條第5項並定負責人加重其刑至二分之一。",
 "What criminal liability attaches to failing to take emergency measures or to obey a suspension order?",
 ["Up to three years imprisonment, detention, or a fine of NT$200,000 to NT$5,000,000; disobeying a cease act order brings up to one year, detention or a fine of NT$100,000 to NT$500,000","Up to five years imprisonment, detention, or a fine of NT$300,000 to NT$8,000,000; disobeying a cease act order brings up to two years, detention or a fine of NT$200,000 to NT$1,000,000","Up to one year imprisonment, detention, or a fine of NT$60,000 to NT$1,000,000; disobeying a cease act order brings detention or a fine of NT$30,000 to NT$300,000 imposed consecutively","Not less than seven years imprisonment with a fine up to NT$30,000,000; disobeying a cease act order brings three to ten years with a fine of up to NT$25,000,000 in addition"],
 "Article 34; aggravation under Article 36, paragraph 5."),

(W,"第35條",2,"水污法-申報不實",
 "依本法有申報義務而明知不實仍申報不實，或於業務上作成之文書為虛偽記載者，應負何責任？",
 ["處三年以下有期徒刑、拘役或科或併科新臺幣二十萬元以上三百萬元以下罰金","處新臺幣六千元以上三百萬元以下罰鍰，並通知限期申報，屆期未申報按次處罰","處一年以下有期徒刑、拘役或科或併科新臺幣一萬元以上六十萬元以下罰金","處五年以下有期徒刑，並得併科新臺幣二十萬元以上一千五百萬元以下罰金"],"a",
 "第35條：依本法規定有申報義務，明知為不實之事項而申報不實或於業務上作成之文書為虛偽記載者，處三年以下有期徒刑、拘役或科或併科新臺幣二十萬元以上三百萬元以下罰金。此與第56條「不為申報」處罰鍰不同，第56條係行政罰而本條為刑罰。",
 "What liability attaches to knowingly false reporting or false entries in business documents?",
 ["Up to three years imprisonment, detention, or a fine of NT$200,000 to NT$3,000,000 imposed alone or in addition","An administrative fine of NT$6,000 to NT$3,000,000 with an order to report, imposed consecutively if still not reported","Up to one year imprisonment, detention, or a fine of NT$10,000 to NT$600,000 imposed alone or in addition","Up to five years imprisonment, with an additional fine of NT$200,000 to NT$15,000,000 imposed at the same time"],
 "Article 35; contrast the administrative fine in Article 56."),

(W,"第36條",3,"水污法-有害健康物質",
 "事業排放於土壤或地面水體之廢（污）水所含有害健康物質超過管制標準者，與注入地下水體含有害健康物質者，刑度各為何？",
 ["前者處三年以下有期徒刑、拘役或科或併科新臺幣二十萬元以上五百萬元以下罰金；後者處一年以上七年以下有期徒刑、拘役或科或併科二十萬元以上二千萬元以下罰金","前者處一年以上七年以下有期徒刑並得併科新臺幣二千萬元以下罰金；後者處三年以下有期徒刑、拘役或科或併科新臺幣二十萬元以上五百萬元以下罰金，二者刑度恰相反","前者與後者刑度完全相同，均處三年以下有期徒刑、拘役或科或併科新臺幣二十萬元以上五百萬元以下罰金，並均得按次處罰至改善完成為止","前者處拘役或科新臺幣六萬元以上六百萬元以下罰金；後者處二年以下有期徒刑、拘役或科或併科新臺幣十萬元以上一千萬元以下罰金並得沒收設備"],"a",
 "第36條第1項：排放於土壤或地面水體之廢（污）水所含有害健康物質超過管制標準者，處三年以下有期徒刑、拘役或科或併科新臺幣二十萬元以上五百萬元以下罰金。第2項：注入地下水體之廢（污）水含有害健康物質者，處一年以上七年以下有期徒刑、拘役或科或併科新臺幣二十萬元以上二千萬元以下罰金。第4項有害健康物質之種類、限值由中央主管機關公告。",
 "What penalties apply to excess health hazardous substances discharged to soil or surface water, versus injected into groundwater?",
 ["The former up to three years imprisonment, detention or a fine of NT$200,000 to NT$5,000,000; the latter one to seven years, detention or a fine of NT$200,000 to NT$20,000,000","The former one to seven years imprisonment with an added fine up to NT$20,000,000; the latter up to three years, detention or a fine of NT$200,000 to NT$5,000,000, exactly reversed","Both carry exactly the same penalty of up to three years imprisonment, detention or a fine of NT$200,000 to NT$5,000,000, and both may be imposed again for each further breach","The former detention or a fine of NT$60,000 to NT$6,000,000; the latter up to two years, detention or a fine of NT$100,000 to NT$10,000,000 together with confiscation of equipment"],
 "Article 36, paragraphs 1, 2 and 4."),

(W,"第36條",3,"水污法-加重情形",
 "犯第36條第1項之罪並有哪些情形時，刑度加重為五年以下有期徒刑得併科二十萬元以上一千五百萬元以下罰金？",
 ["無排放許可證或簡易排放許可文件、違反第十八條之一第一項繞流排放規定、違反第三十二條第一項注入地下水體或排放土壤規定者","未於期限內完成改善、拒絕主管機關進入查證、未設置廢水處理專責人員或未依規定申報放流水水質水量檢驗測定結果者","排放水量每日超過一千立方公尺、位於總量管制區內、未設置放流水水質水量自動監測系統或未依規定校正監測儀器者","經一年內二次限期改善仍繼續違反、未將許可文件公開於指定網站、未於改善期限屆滿前檢具證明文件送交主管機關者"],"a",
 "第36條第3項：犯第一項之罪而有下列情形之一者，處五年以下有期徒刑，得併科新臺幣二十萬元以上一千五百萬元以下罰金：一、無排放許可證或簡易排放許可文件；二、違反第十八條之一第一項規定（繞流排放）；三、違反第三十二條第一項規定。第5項並定負責人或監督策劃人員犯第34條至本條第3項之罪者，加重其刑至二分之一。",
 "Which circumstances raise an Article 36 paragraph 1 offence to up to five years with a fine of NT$200,000 to NT$15,000,000?",
 ["Having no discharge permit or simplified permit document, breaching the bypass discharge ban in Article 18-1 paragraph 1, or breaching Article 32 paragraph 1","Failing to improve within the deadline, refusing entry for inspection, not appointing dedicated wastewater personnel, or not reporting effluent test results as required","Discharging over one thousand cubic metres daily, being inside a total load control zone, not installing automatic monitoring, or not calibrating the monitoring instruments","Continuing to breach after two improvement orders in one year, not publishing permits on the designated website, or not filing proof before the improvement deadline"],
 "Article 36, paragraphs 3 and 5."),

(W,"第37條",3,"水污法-加重結果犯",
 "犯第34條、第36條之罪或排放廢（污）水超過放流水標準，因而致人於死者，刑度為何？致重傷者呢？",
 ["致人於死者處無期徒刑或七年以上有期徒刑，得併科新臺幣三千萬元以下罰金；致重傷者處三年以上十年以下有期徒刑，得併科新臺幣二千五百萬元以下罰金","致人於死者處十年以上有期徒刑，得併科新臺幣二千萬元以下罰金；致重傷者處一年以上七年以下有期徒刑，得併科新臺幣一千五百萬元以下罰金","致人於死者處七年以上有期徒刑，得併科新臺幣一千萬元以下罰金；致重傷者處六月以上五年以下有期徒刑，得併科新臺幣五百萬元以下罰金","致人於死者處死刑或無期徒刑，得併科新臺幣五千萬元以下罰金；致重傷者處五年以上十二年以下有期徒刑，得併科新臺幣三千萬元以下罰金"],"a",
 "第37條：犯第三十四條、第三十六條之罪或排放廢（污）水超過放流水標準，因而致人於死者，處無期徒刑或七年以上有期徒刑，得併科新臺幣三千萬元以下罰金；致重傷者，處三年以上十年以下有期徒刑，得併科新臺幣二千五百萬元以下罰金；致危害人體健康導致疾病或嚴重污染環境者，處一年以上七年以下有期徒刑，得併科新臺幣二千萬元以下罰金。",
 "What penalty applies where such offences or excess discharge cause death, and where they cause serious injury?",
 ["Death: life imprisonment or at least seven years, with a fine up to NT$30,000,000; serious injury: three to ten years, with a fine up to NT$25,000,000 in addition","Death: at least ten years imprisonment, with a fine up to NT$20,000,000; serious injury: one to seven years, with a fine up to NT$15,000,000 imposed in addition","Death: at least seven years imprisonment, with a fine up to NT$10,000,000; serious injury: six months to five years, with a fine up to NT$5,000,000 in addition","Death: capital punishment or life imprisonment, with a fine up to NT$50,000,000; serious injury: five to twelve years, with a fine up to NT$30,000,000 in addition"],
 "Article 37."),

(W,"第38條",1,"水污法-條文刪除",
 "水污染防治法第三十八條之現行狀態為何？",
 ["該條業經刪除，現行條文僅保留條次而無實質內容規定","該條規定事業排放廢水應設置流量計並每日記錄之義務","該條規定廢水代處理業之許可證申請程序及其管理辦法","該條規定水污染防治費之分期繳納方式及滯納金之計算"],"a",
 "第38條：（刪除）。本法尚有第65條亦為刪除條文。條文刪除後條次仍予保留，以免影響其他條文之引用關係，例如第39條仍規定法人負責人、代理人、受僱人因執行業務犯第34條至第37條之罪之兩罰規定。",
 "What is the current status of Article 38 of the Water Pollution Control Act?",
 ["The article has been deleted, and only the article number remains without any substantive content","The article requires enterprises to install flow meters and keep daily records of discharge","The article sets the permit application procedure and regulations for wastewater treatment agents","The article prescribes instalment payment of the water pollution control fee and late payment interest"],
 "Article 38 (deleted); Article 65 is likewise deleted."),

(W,"第39條",2,"水污法-兩罰",
 "法人之負責人、代理人、受僱人因執行業務犯第34條至第37條之罪者，對該法人或自然人如何處理？",
 ["除依各該條規定處罰其行為人外，對該法人或自然人亦科以各該條十倍以下之罰金","僅處罰實際行為人，法人或自然人一律不受任何處罰，以符責任個別化原則","對該法人或自然人科以各該條二倍以下之罰金，行為人本身則得減輕其刑度","對該法人或自然人處以停業或勒令歇業處分，不另科處任何金額之罰金刑"],"a",
 "第39條：法人之負責人、法人或自然人之代理人、受僱人或其他從業人員，因執行業務犯第三十四條至第三十七條之罪者，除依各該條規定處罰其行為人外，對該法人或自然人亦科以各該條十倍以下之罰金。第36條第5項另定負責人或監督策劃人員犯第34條至第36條第3項之罪者加重其刑至二分之一。",
 "Where staff commit Articles 34 to 37 offences in the course of business, how is the juristic person treated?",
 ["Besides punishing the actual offender under those articles, the juristic or natural person is fined up to ten times the amount there","Only the actual offender is punished, and the juristic or natural person bears no penalty at all under individual responsibility","The juristic or natural person is fined up to twice the amount there, while the actual offender may have the sentence reduced","The juristic or natural person is ordered to suspend or close the business, with no criminal fine imposed in addition"],
 "Article 39; see also Article 36, paragraph 5."),

(W,"第39條之1",3,"水污法-揭弊者保護",
 "事業對於向主管機關揭露違法行為之廢水處理專責人員，有何禁止規定？相關舉證責任如何分配？",
 ["不得因其揭露、擔任證人或拒絕參與違法行為而予解僱、降調、減薪或其他不利處分，所為處分無效；事業就不利處分與該行為無關之事實負舉證責任","得依內部人事規章予以調職或減薪，但不得解僱；受不利處分之專責人員應自行舉證證明該處分與其揭露行為間具有因果關係，否則不予救濟","僅禁止解僱，降調或減薪不在限制之列；主管機關應依職權調查該不利處分之原因，事業與受僱人雙方均不負任何舉證責任而由機關認定","得於揭露行為經查證不實時予以解僱；受不利處分者應向勞動主管機關申訴，事業僅須提出人事評核紀錄即可推定該處分為合法有效"],"a",
 "第39條之1第1項至第3項：事業或污水下水道系統不得因專責人員或其他受僱人向主管機關或司法機關揭露違法行為、擔任訴訟證人或拒絕參與違法行為而予解僱、降調、減薪或其他不利處分；所為處分無效；事業對於該不利處分與第一項行為無關之事實負舉證責任。第4項並定曾參與違法行為而揭露或自白自首因而查獲其他正犯或共犯者，減輕或免除其刑。",
 "What protection do whistleblowing wastewater personnel enjoy, and who bears the burden of proof?",
 ["No dismissal, demotion, pay cut or other adverse action for disclosing, testifying or refusing to join a breach, such action being void; the enterprise must prove the action was unrelated","Transfer or pay cuts are allowed under internal rules but not dismissal; the affected employee must prove a causal link between the action and the disclosure or gets no remedy","Only dismissal is barred, demotion and pay cuts being unrestricted; the authority investigates the cause and neither side bears any burden of proof in the matter","Dismissal is allowed where the disclosure later proves unfounded; the affected employee complains to the labour authority, and personnel appraisal records presume the action lawful and valid"],
 "Article 39-1, paragraphs 1 to 4."),
]
